# Privacy Policy — SpinDecide

**Effective Date:** October 23, 2026

**Developer:** Mazlum Cihangir

**Contact:** mazlumkaya012345@gmail.com

## 1. Introduction

Welcome to SpinDecide.

This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the SpinDecide mobile application, developed by Mazlum Cihangir.

We are committed to respecting user privacy and providing transparency about our data practices.

## 2. App Features

SpinDecide provides interactive decision wheels, party games, conversation questions, sound effects, animations, and customization options.

The application is available as a one-time paid download for $2.99 USD, subject to regional pricing.

All included VIP features are available without additional in-app purchases.

## 3. Information Collection

SpinDecide is designed to function without requiring users to register or create an account.

The application's actual data collection and sharing practices, including those of any integrated third-party services, will be disclosed here following technical verification.

## 4. Payments

SpinDecide is distributed through Google Play.

Google Play processes purchases under Google's applicable terms and privacy practices.

For more information, visit:

https://policies.google.com/privacy

## 5. Local Storage

SpinDecide may store preferences and settings locally on your device, including sound, appearance, and gameplay preferences.

Any additional storage or data transmission practices will be disclosed following verification.

## 6. Third-Party Services

Any third-party services integrated into SpinDecide, including their data processing purposes and applicable privacy policies, will be identified here following technical verification.

## 7. Data Security

We aim to protect user privacy by minimizing unnecessary data processing and applying appropriate security measures.

## 8. Data Retention and Deletion

Data retention and deletion practices will be detailed according to the application's verified functionality.

For privacy-related questions or requests, contact mazlumkaya012345@gmail.com.

## 9. Children's Privacy

SpinDecide's intended audience and the applicable protections for younger users will be specified according to its content and Google Play requirements.

## 10. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when our features, services, or data practices change.

Changes will be published with an updated effective date.

